<v Ira Glass>WBEZ对我们节目的管理监督由托里·马拉蒂亚先生负责，我这周在他办公室撞见了他。

00:58:33.900 --> 00:58:38.610
<v Kristy Colvin>And he's laying in the middle of the carpet, rolling around and laying around.
<v Kristy Colvin>然后他躺在地毯中间，滚来滚去。

00:58:38.610 --> 00:58:56.310
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
